"║┌Highlights──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐║"
"║│  [Added] **`maestro insight scan`** — a static maintenance-map extractor that emits a versioned `docs/insight/scan.json`: extractor scaffold, schema, `repo_stats`, and module │║"
"║│  [Fixed] Team Picker now lists `[teams.*]` teams defined in `maestro.toml` — `populate_team_wizard_data` merges inline project-config teams into the loader, which previously s│║"
"║│  [Fixed] Interaction sessions now require a second confirm before quitting with unsaved work, so an in-progress turn is not lost to an accidental quit. (#1008)                │║"
"║│  [Changed] L1 sub-agent dispatch now routes each role to its bound provider (`RoleBinding.agent` → `fallback_agent` → factory default), matching the L2 routing shipped in #881│║"
